# Task 4 - Daily AWS Cost Alert Using Cost Explorer API and SNS

## Objective

Automatically monitor AWS month-to-date spending and send an email alert when the configured cost threshold is exceeded.

## AWS Services Used

- AWS Lambda
- AWS Cost Explorer API
- Amazon SNS
- Amazon EventBridge
- IAM
- Amazon CloudWatch

## Features

- Retrieves month-to-date Unblended Cost using the AWS Cost Explorer API.
- Compares the current cost against a configurable threshold.
- Sends an SNS email notification when the threshold is exceeded.
- Logs the current AWS spend in CloudWatch.
- Can be scheduled to run daily using Amazon EventBridge.

## Testing

For testing, the threshold was temporarily set to **$0.01** to force an alert. After successful verification, the threshold was restored to the production value of **$50.00**.

## Scheduling

The Lambda function is scheduled to execute daily using Amazon EventBridge.

## Production Note

AWS Budgets provides a managed solution for cost monitoring and notifications.

AWS Lambda is preferred when custom logic is required, such as service-wise cost analysis, Slack or Microsoft Teams notifications, anomaly detection, or integration with external systems.
